# Schoenberger et al. 2024: the MQT IonShuttler, exact (SAT) router.

ruleset "ionshuttler"
title "IonShuttler's rules (exact router)"
about "A rail and a junction hold one ion at a time; every operation lasts one time step of the paper's model; each qubit's gates run in the circuit's order. The paper's replay also checks its own model's rules about the processing zone, beside these."

use R0, R1, R2, R3, R8, R24, R25, R29
